,0,'COMMON','COMMON','ETC',75,5,4,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-05 00:00:00',12,6102,0),(53,'Super Tank Power Pack','A super power pack that keeps a tank running for 7 days.','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'SLAYER','COMMON','ETC',75,9,4,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-06 00:00:00',5,6103,0),(54,'Super Enriched Blood Pack','A super-concentrated blood pack that feeds a demon bat for 7 days.','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'VAMPIRE','COMMON','ETC',75,13,4,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-07 00:00:00',5,6104,0),(55,'Large Dew','Fresh dew that nourishes a little sprite for 7 days.','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'OUSTERS','COMMON','ETC',75,17,4,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-08 00:00:00',5,6105,0),(56,'Mesh Skin M VIII','Grade VIII men\'s Slayer coat, very light and highly elastic. No attribute. Level 150 only.','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'SLAYER','COMMON','ITEM',11,24,8,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-09 00:00:00',48,7101,0),(57,'Mesh Skin W VIII','Grade VIII women\'s Slayer coat, very light and highly elastic. No attribute. Level 150 only.','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'SLAYER','COMMON','ITEM',11,25,8,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-10 00:00:00',48,7102,0),(58,'Cling Slack M VIII','Grade VIII men\'s Slayer trousers, very light and highly elastic. No attribute. Level 150 only.','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'SLAYER','COMMON','ITEM',12,24,8,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-11 00:00:00',48,7103,0),(59,'Cling Slack W VIII','Grade VIII women\'s Slayer trousers, very light and highly elastic. No attribute. Level 150 only.','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'SLAYER','COMMON','ITEM',12,25,8,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-12 00:00:00',48,7104,0),(60,'Niddle Edger VIII','Fine blades were once made only by a handful of master smiths, but rising demand drew many arms makers into swordmaking. A prototype by S&W became the standard, the SWMS 3000, known to all as the "Niddle Edger". No attribute. Level 150 only.','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'SLAYER','COMMON','ITEM',14,14,8,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-13 00:00:00',48,7105,0),(61,'Duocarpo VIII','Nearly as tall as a man, it can only be wielded with both hands, hence the name Duocarpo. Its broad, thick blade makes it very heavy, so even a simple swing is devastating. Few can wield it, so very few exist. No attribute. Level 150 only.','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'SLAYER','COMMON','ITEM',15,14,8,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-14 00:00:00',48,7106,0),(62,'Salience Asser VIII','In the hands of the Granters, the Salience Asser takes an imposing form, yet it is not meant for direct blows. Made of attribute-free metal, it channels the Granters\' magic well, and its worth is fully recognized. No attribute. Level 150 only.','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'SLAYER','COMMON','ITEM',35,12,8,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-15 00:00:00',48,7107,0),(63,'Spur Buckler VIII','A shield designed around the fact that Vampire and Ousters physical attacks are mostly cuts and thrusts. Its rim of thick titanium alloy fends off blows from the side, and metal studs reinforce the thinner center. No attribute. Level 150 only.','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'SLAYER','COMMON','ITEM',16,13,8,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-16 00:00:00',37,7108,0),(64,'Battalion VIII','Fitted with an integrated TA/FCS system, it can spot targets at night or in foul weather and marks the figures needed for aiming on the user\'s terminal. No attribute. Level 150 only.','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'SLAYER','COMMON','ITEM',22,14,8,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-17 00:00:00',48,7109,0),(65,'Reliant Crucis VIII','Named for the believers who show who they are with a cross of their own faith, whether a plain cross or one of another shape. No attribute. Level 150 only.','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'SLAYER','COMMON','ITEM',17,12,8,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-18 00:00:00',48,7110,0),(66,'Tactical Scout VIII','A Mauser-type bolt-action repeating rifle. Its long action and the rifling typical of Mauser guns make fast, accurate shots easy, so it is highly prized on the battlefield. No attribute. Level 150 only.','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'SLAYER','COMMON','ITEM',23,14,8,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-19 00:00:00',48,7111,0),(67,'Mount Goggle VIII','Earlier headgear was built to stop bullets, which is useless against Vampires. This model focuses on clear vision and communications instead, yet its sturdy frame also shields the side of the neck. Being fairly light, it is well regarded overall. No attribute. Level 150 only.','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'SLAYER','COMMON','ITEM',19,13,8,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-20 00:00:00',37,7112,0),(68,'Defiance Cloak VIII','Less stately than a master\'s coat but made for agility, it is worn by young Vampires who mean to step out of their masters\' shadow. No attribute. Level 150, male Vampires only.','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'VAMPIRE','COMMON','ITEM',33,20,8,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-21 00:00:00',48,7201,0),(69,'Allure Apparel VIII','A Vampire\'s bewitching charm is a proven weapon, and a female Vampire\'s can disarm even a wary foe. Newborn Vampires need clothing that makes the most of it. Cut from thin leather and sewn in layers, it guards well against silver bullets and blades. No attribute. Level 150, female Vampires only.','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'VAMPIRE','COMMON','ITEM',33,21,8,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-22 00:00:00',48,7202,0),(70,'Acies Nail VIII','Its long, slender blades pierce even thick gloves to reach deep into the body, and their wide curve keeps the prey from slipping free; any who escape carry gaping wounds. Some complain the prey bleeds so much that little blood is left to drink. No attribute. Level 150, Vampires only.','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'VAMPIRE','COMMON','ITEM',44,19,8,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-23 00:00:00',48,7203,0),(71,'Praelium Vestio VIII','The Ousters chosen as warriors cast aside their bright, clear nature and had to seek out darkness. They all dress in purple, the color of death. No attribute. Level 150 only.','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'OUSTERS','COMMON','ITEM',61,12,8,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-24 00:00:00',48,7301,0),(72,'Praelium Boots VIII','The Ousters chosen as warriors cast aside their bright, clear nature and had to seek out darkness. They all dress in purple, the color of death. Purple stands for both death and a noble soul, and for giving oneself wholly to the god of death. No attribute. Level 150 only.','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'OUSTERS','COMMON','ITEM',58,12,8,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-25 00:00:00',48,7302,0),(73,'Melis Chakram VIII','A ring holding the power of Melis, spirit of sorrow, that grows deadlier as it absorbs its victims\' pain and grief. Its four spikes, set at different angles, make even a single hit hard to bear. No attribute. Level 150 only.','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'OUSTERS','COMMON','ITEM',59,14,8,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-26 00:00:00',48,7303,0),(74,'Nepirim Wristlet VIII (Fire)','Crafted from the bones of ancient giants, the Nephilim, who were believed to make up the ancient world and were twice as strong as ordinary spirits. Crests are carved on its surface to shield the wearer from their evil aura. No attribute. Level 150 only.','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'OUSTERS','COMMON','ITEM',65,42,8,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-27 00:00:00',48,7304,0),(75,'Nepirim Wristlet VIII (Water)','Crafted from the bones of ancient giants, the Nephilim, who were believed to make up the ancient world and were twice as strong as ordinary spirits. Crests are carved on its surface to shield the wearer from their evil aura. No attribute. Level 150 only.','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'OUSTERS','COMMON','ITEM',65,43,8,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-28 00:00:00',48,7305,0),(76,'Nepirim Wristlet VIII (Earth)','Crafted from the bones of ancient giants, the Nephilim, who were believed to make up the ancient world and were twice as strong as ordinary spirits. Crests are carved on its surface to shield the wearer from their evil aura. No attribute. Level 150 only.','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'OUSTERS','COMMON','ITEM',65,44,8,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-29 00:00:00',48,7306,0),(77,'Toad Back VIII R9/S3 15d','Gear originally planned for EVE\'s heavy infantry. Bulky but light thanks to its multilayered fiber, it protects the shoulders, the part closest to the enemy in a charge, and its studs can be used to strike. Against agile Vampires and Ousters, though, that is easier said than done. It looks like a toad\'s back, hence the name "Toad Back".','FREE','LIMITED',360,'SLAYER','COMMON','ITEM',85,0,8,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-29 00:00:00',48,7307,0),(78,'Crafty Veil VIII R9/S3 15d','A mask once worn by Arab executioners to ward off the grudges of the condemned. It holds the resentment and terror of countless executed souls, and the fear pouring from it robs all who see it of the will to fight.','FREE','LIMITED',360,'VAMPIRE','COMMON','ITEM',87,0,8,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-29 00:00:00',48,7308,0),(79,'Praelium Glove VIII R9/S3 15d','Protective gloves of the priests of the Vatican Knights, a Slayer order under the Catholic Church. Leather plated with metal for defense and mobility, with lavish priestly ornaments. The wrists are white cloth, which weakens them, and on it scripture is written in red blood: "I give you wisdom and power to defeat the devil. Resist bravely, and I will be with you always." Weak in defense, but blessed with holy power.','FREE','LIMITED',360,'OUSTERS','COMMON','ITEM',89,0,8,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-29 00:00:00',48,7309,0),(80,'Toad Back VIII R9/S3 30d','Gear originally planned for EVE\'s heavy infantry. Bulky but light thanks to its multilayered fiber, it protects the shoulders, the part closest to the enemy in a charge, and its studs can be used to strike. Against agile Vampires and Ousters, though, that is easier said than done. It looks like a toad\'s back, hence the name "Toad Back".','FREE','LIMITED',720,'SLAYER','COMMON','ITEM',85,0,8,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-29 00:00:00',48,7310,0),(81,'Crafty Veil VIII R9/S3 30d','A mask once worn by Arab executioners to ward off the grudges of the condemned. It holds the resentment and terror of countless executed souls, and the fear pouring from it robs all who see it of the will to fight.','FREE','LIMITED',720,'VAMPIRE','COMMON','ITEM',87,0,8,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-29 00:00:00',48,7311,0),(82,'Praelium Glove VIII R9/S3 30d','Protective gloves of the priests of the Vatican Knights, a Slayer order under the Catholic Church. Leather plated with metal for defense and mobility, with lavish priestly ornaments. The wrists are white cloth, which weakens them, and on it scripture is written in red blood: "I give you wisdom and power to defeat the devil. Resist bravely, and I will be with you always." Weak in defense, but blessed with holy power.','FREE','LIMITED',720,'OUSTERS','COMMON','ITEM',89,0,8,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-29 00:00:00',48,7312,0),(83,'Ticket x10','10 tickets to the Asylion treasure map. Red PK gear drops in the Asylion Dungeon.','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'COMMON','COMMON','ITEM',72,3,0,'',10,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-29 00:00:00',100,7400,0),(84,'Ticket x20','20 tickets to the Asylion treasure map. Red PK gear drops in the Asylion Dungeon.','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'COMMON','COMMON','ITEM',72,3,0,'',20,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-29 00:00:00',200,7401,0),(85,'Ticket x30','30 tickets to the Asylion treasure map. Red PK gear drops in the Asylion Dungeon.','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'COMMON','COMMON','ITEM',72,3,0,'',30,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-29 00:00:00',250,7402,0),(86,'Ticket (7 days)','VIP ticket to the Asylion treasure map: unlimited entry for 15 days. Red PK gear drops in the Asylion Dungeon.','FREE','LIMITED',360,'COMMON','COMMON','ITEM',72,3,0,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-29 00:00:00',210,7403,0),(87,'Ticket (15 days)','VIP ticket to the Asylion treasure map: unlimited entry for 30 days. Red PK gear drops in the Asylion Dungeon.','FREE','LIMITED',720,'COMMON','COMMON','ITEM',72,3,0,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-29 00:00:00',400,7404,0),(88,'Fear Aura Stone','','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'COMMON','COMMON','ITEM',54,58,0,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-29 00:00:00',190,4405,0),(89,'Cruel Aura Stone','','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'COMMON','COMMON','ITEM',54,59,0,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-29 00:00:00',190,4406,0),(90,'Hope Aura Stone','','FREE','UNLIMITED',0,'COMMON','COMMON','ITEM',54,60,0,'',1,'',1,0,0,'2003-06-29 00:00:00',190,4407,0),(91,'Natural Aura Stone','','FREE','UNL